# Phase 133.1, F7 from the 2026-11-07 night: at 01:42 calibration started
# with the planet 348 px from the top of the frame, its moves carried it
# toward the edge, and the operator had to jog. Calibration must now
# refuse a target within 20% of an edge. A FINE jog for 0.6 s moves the
# star about 140" (some 700 px at 0.2"/px) from the middle of the full
# sensor: inside the frame, inside the 20% margin.
name    Guide: calibration refuses a star near the edge
timeout 300

env     RADUK_EMU_NEXSTAR=1
profile star.ini focuser position=168000
profile star.ini roi width=3840
profile star.ini roi height=2160

expect 30  [SCENARIO] Guide: calibration refuses
wait   3
press  FINE
goto   Kochab
expect 120 SEARCHING
wait   5
keydown UP
wait   0.6
keyup  UP
wait   3
press  PLANET LOCK
expect 90  centre it roughly
absent 5   [CAL] direction check
shot   refused
